{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Primordial Echoes relaunches Primordial Blast on a critical strike (#2742)",
  "contract": [
    "Primordial Echoes 705572 Effect0 is SPELL_AURA_PROC_TRIGGER_SPELL, ProcChance 40, trigger 547525.",
    "Spell.dbc ProcFlags is 0 and, before the fix, no spell_proc row existed, so it never fired. Primordial",
    "Blast (800732 and its ranks) is family 38, SpellFamilyFlags0/1/2 4194304/1048576/64, DmgClass magic,",
    "a harmful SPELL_EFFECT_SCHOOL_DAMAGE hit. After the fix (spell_proc row scoped to Primordial Blast,",
    "hit phase, HitMask restricted to PROC_HIT_CRITICAL), repeated crits on Primordial Blast must",
    "eventually cast 547525 again. spell_crit_rating is set high enough to push spell crit chance near",
    "100% so the loop exercises the 40% proc roll rather than the native crit roll; 20 trials at 40% bound",
    "the flake rate to 0.6^20 (about 0.0037%) of seeing zero procs."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
